;================================================================================

		;GATHERING IF ONLY FLUSH (low-gold)

;====================FEUDAL SCOUTS OR SKIRMS (high food, high wood, low gold) ;STARTING LOW OR HIGH GOLD
(defrule
(goal REACTIVE-GATHERING no)
(goal castle-pending no)
(goal TRUSH no)
(goal FLUSH yes)
