;----------GATHERING IF DEFEND-FEUDAL IS YES (low gold)---------- ;NOTE: defend-feudal needs to be below all flushing rules to prevent potential bugs (flush yes & defend-feudal yes causes gathering bugs)
(defrule
(goal REACTIVE-GATHERING no)
(goal castle-pending no)
(goal defend-feudal yes)
(unit-type-count-total villager > 20)
(gold-amount < 200)
(current-age == feudal-age)
(current-age-time < 120); first 120 seconds of gathering
=>
(set-strategic-number sn-food-gatherer-percentage 40)
(set-strategic-number sn-wood-gatherer-percentage 55) ;60
(set-strategic-number sn-gold-gatherer-percentage 5) ;0
(set-strategic-number sn-stone-gatherer-percentage 0) ; for towers (none in the first 2 minutes so we can focus on food and wood first)
)
